<title>ITALY: Port conditions update - Italy - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Italy - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>GENOA, Oct 7 - one bulk carrier waiting for a berth, delay 12-24 hours. SAVONA - no vessels waiting for normal berth and one vessel waiting for special berth.</p>
</text>
